      629        EDGE-PIXELS 2 GRAPHIC-EDGE  NO-FILL
      630        SIZE 28.5 BY 3.83.
      631   DEFINE RECTANGLE RECT-7
      632        EDGE-PIXELS 2 GRAPHIC-EDGE  NO-FILL
      633        SIZE 28.5 BY 2.25.
      634   DEFINE RECTANGLE RECT-8
