      647        LABEL "Скорость продаж"
      648        VIEW-AS TOGGLE-BOX
      649        SIZE 24.5 BY .83 NO-UNDO.
      650   DEFINE FRAME F-Main
      651        RADIO-SET-1 AT ROW 2.88 COL 5.25 NO-LABEL
