      861     END PROCEDURE.
      862   PROCEDURE adm-copy-record :
      863       MESSAGE "Object ":U THIS-PROCEDURE:FILE-NAME
      864        "must have at least one Enabled Table to perform Copy.":U
      865          VIEW-AS ALERT-BOX ERROR.
      866       RETURN.
